		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: Concurrent Physics Engine with Synthetic Sense Modelling]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=38197#p38197"><![CDATA[
The collision module of the physics engine can help you since it usually provides API for ray and convex casts or volume queries. Those are useful to implement touch, sight or hearing obviously. You don't want to duplicate those in an AI system.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=14">Dirk Gregorius</a> — Tue Sep 13, 2016 7:47 pm</p><hr />
